    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet est le renforcement de la durabilit&#xe9; des installations biologiques au Ghana afin d&#x2019;am&#xe9;liorer la pr&#xe9;vention et la d&#xe9;tection des mati&#xe8;res li&#xe9;es aux armes biologiques, ainsi que la r&#xe9;ponse &#xe0; leur prolif&#xe9;ration.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcome of this project is strengthened the sustainability of biological facilities in Ghana to improve the prevention and detection of materials related to biological weapons, as well as the response to their proliferation.</narrative>
